Releases are frozen until the v0.3.0 chain is complete.

The UI now talks only to the unified mail delegate. It does not read the
identities, contacts or local state kept by the v0.2.x delegates until the
migration from those delegates lands, so a release from this tree would
show existing users an empty app. scripts/check-release-freeze.sh refuses
while this file exists; scripts/release.sh and the publish-email,
publish-container and publish-production tasks run it first. The v0.3.0
release removes it.
